# Control flow

Guard at the top. A 2-branch `if/else` is fine when both branches continue.

```dart
String formatGreeting(String? name) {
  if (name == null || name.isEmpty) return 'Hello, stranger!';
  return 'Hello, $name!';
}
```

Bloc UI uses freezed `when` so every state is handled:

```dart
state.when(
  initial: () => const SizedBox(),
  loading: () => const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator()),
  loaded: (model) => NewsContent(model: model),
);
```

Enums use a switch expression:

```dart
Color colorFor(LightColor color) => switch (color) {
  LightColor.red => Colors.red,
  LightColor.yellow => Colors.yellow,
  LightColor.green => Colors.green,
};
```
